    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling water all over my forearm while making tea... its really red and starting to blister kinda bad. it hurts so much. i have some tea tree oil and some butter in the kitchen, should i put one of those on it to help it cool down and stop it from getting infected??",
