      "content": "You can apply a thick layer of plain aloe vera gel to soothe the pain, but skip the antibiotic ointment as it can trap heat and cause irritation. Cover the area with a sterile, non-stick bandage to seal it in and protect it while you work, but do not remove it until the next morning. If the redness spreads further or you feel feverish, you will need to see a doctor immediately, but for now, this simple treatment will keep you comfortable.",
